{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.poster.avif?t=1765430402\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.webm?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.mp4?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Edge of Oblivion is a turn-based action roguelike. Face off against an ever growing horde as you battle towards the final boss. Create dynamic <i>(and frankly absurd)</i> builds to cleave through your foes. Think a few steps ahead and perfectly utilize your items to master the battlefield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/9238fb36e76a9ea41e818d4b9a72371d.poster.avif?t=1765430402\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/9238fb36e76a9ea41e818d4b9a72371d.webm?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/9238fb36e76a9ea41e818d4b9a72371d.mp4?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Blast shadows of the past with chain lightning, slash at them with swords, and don a cape made of dragon scales! No matter what items you are drawn to, craft your own playstyle through upgrades and synergies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Absurd builds: Curate a unique style of play each run<br></li><li> Bosses: Oblivion is full of bosses, ripe for the fighting, are you up for the challenge?<br></li><li> Simple turns: Each turn is simple and fast, look a few turns ahead and feel the satisfaction of utilizing your items to their best.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1354590?t=1765430402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1354590?t=1765430402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765430402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765430402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.poster.avif?t=1765430402\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.webm?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/89539dc68daac0df077990aeba77d061.mp4?t=1765430402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Edge of Oblivion is a turn-based action roguelike. Face off against an ever growing horde as you battle towards the final boss. Create dynamic <i>(and frankly absurd)</i> builds to cleave through your foes. Think a few steps ahead and perfectly utilize your items to master the battlefield.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1354590/extras/9238fb36e76a9ea41e818d4b9a72371d.poster.avif?t=1765430402\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic